__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/

# Raw/derived pilot-run data: regenerable from the cluster run + assemble_bundle.py
# + normalize_b.py, and too large for git (normalized.json alone can be 100s of MB).
# Small provenance (assemble configs, calibration_holdout, *-extracted/ check
# reports, canary reports, markdown notes) stays tracked.
evidence/pilot_runs/b-pilot-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]
evidence/pilot_runs/b-pilot-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-partial
evidence/pilot_runs/*-bundle.json
evidence/pilot_runs/*-normalized.json

# Raw GPU trace data: every CSV under this tree is rocprofv3's native trace
# output (kernel/hip_api/agent_info/marker rows), never source or config.
# We do not push measurement data to the repo, regardless of size.
*.csv
